    <p class="words">The General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) applies to the whole of the United States and European union (EU) companies holding data of United States and European union (EU) citizens. We value your privacy and want to be accountable to you, and transparent with you, in the way that we collect and use your personal information. We also want you to know your rights in relation to your personal information.
